y-off of the match or guiding your squad by drafting champions and taking real-time decisions during simulated esports matches. And when you face the excited crowd waiting for you just remember: success belongs to your players, but it is the coaches who own the losses.</p>","developers":["UPLAY Online"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897410/header.jpg?t=1736782214","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Esports Life Tycoon. Published and Developed by UPLAY Online \u00a9 UPLAY Online SL. All rights reserved. Esports Life Tycoon is a trademark of UPLAY Online. All other copyrights and trademarks are the property of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.8+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64 bit 2 GHz or faster processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/897410/348642/cba7e15af8977a3a27b2f70fa74a2bc34ba25b90/1751159969/dash_av1.mpd?t=1613582213","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/897410/348642/cba7e15af8977a3a27b2f70fa74a2bc34ba25b90/1751159969/dash_h264.mpd?t=1613582213","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/897410/348642/cba7e15af8977a3a27b2f70fa74a2bc34ba25b90/1751159969/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1613582213","id":256822846,"name":"Full Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256822846/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1613582213"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/